   "name": "Gakin the Darkbinder",
   "npc": "6122",
   "questID": 1716,
   "race": "Human",
   "sex": "f",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "A sayaad is a devourer of souls, dominator of wills, and tempter of hearts. It knows nothing but evil.\r\n\r\nSalacious tales refer to the demon by its common name: succubus for females, incubus for males.\r\n\r\nA stimulus is required to beckon the creature. With a symbol of love as bait, it will surely answer your call. Defeat it, and make it your tool.\r\n\r\nIt will be hard to find a thing of this nature, though. You should speak with Takar the Seer. You will find him in the Barrens of Kalimdor near Camp Taurajo.",
   "time": 1791316856,
   "title": "Devourer of Souls",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Stormwind City"
  },
